WEBVTT

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:34.640
Although Prince Shotoku is said 
to have laid the foundations

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:36.870
for a centralized national bureaucracy,

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:40.620
more than a few scholars question 
whether he ever really existed.

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:43.620
Asuka Period

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:42.680
Oh, say, have you heard this?

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:47.870
Legend has it that Prince Shotoku 
went to Mt. Fuji on a flying horse!

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:50.200
No way, Arai-sensei!

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.380
Horses can't fly!

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:10.790
<i>Ever since we got back from Mt. Fuji,</i>

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:14.160
<i>it's been hard for me to face Hinata,</i>

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:18.180
<i>and Hinata herself has been 
unusually careful around me.</i>

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:20.100
<i>Meanwhile...</i>

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:26.790
It's summer break!

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:25.760
<i>summer break has arrived.</i>

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:27.540
Mountain Trail

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:30.790
Season 2 - New Climb 12

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:01.420
<i>I need to empty out my backpack.</i>

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:04.970
<i>I never did use that head lamp...</i>

00:03:05.970 --> 00:03:08.780
<i>When did I buy a plushie?</i>

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:11.520
<i>And there's the sweet bean jelly.</i>

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:14.250
<i>Wasn't that Hinata's?</i>

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:17.450
<i>Not like it matters.</i>

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:20.570
I see...

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:22.970
I hope Aoi-san is feeling okay.

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:25.830
Since then, she's seemed down.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:28.600
Even texting her feels too awkward.

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:34.730
If only Kaede-san were here.

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:37.570
Later! I'm off to traverse the Northern Alps!

00:03:37.740 --> 00:03:40.320
I'm going to cross the Big Ridge Gap in Nagano!

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:47.470
Shall we go visit Aoi-san?

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:53.720
I think it's probably best if 
we don't bug her right now.

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:57.760
But, don't worry!

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:00.210
I'm sure she'll be feeling better in no time!

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:00.710
Right?

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:03.580
Right...

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:06.690
Well, see you later.

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:08.760
Yeah, I'll call you!

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:43.980
<i>Even though it's summer break,</i>

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:45.880
<i>I'm laying around doing nothing.</i>

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:48.510
<i>Is this really what I want?</i>

00:04:49.050 --> 00:04:52.750
<i>Ever since then, it's like there's 
been a gaping hole in my heart,</i>

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:55.520
<i>and nothing I do seems to help.</i>

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:09.200
Aoi!

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:12.350
Aoi?

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:19.670
Yes?

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:21.670
You have mail.

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:23.880
Crown Prince

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:27.130
From Hinata and Kokona-chan?

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.130
To Yukimura Aoi

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:28.640
Mt. Fuji Rim Peak
Shizuoka
Mt. Fuji Summit

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:32.840
<i>The mail they sent from Mt. Fuji 
took until now to be delivered.</i>

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:42.380
Mom, I'm going out for a bit.

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:44.540
It's hot, so wear a hat.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.660
Muuma

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:03.920
Mt. Tenran 
Ascent 
Start

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:11.830
After Mt. Tenran, Mt. Takao and Mt. Mitsutouge,

00:06:11.830 --> 00:06:14.270
we've now reached Mt. Fuji!

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:16.680
Let's climb the mountain 
of our memories someday!

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:20.430
<i>How come Hinata has such good handwriting?</i>

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.860
<i>This was our first one.</i>

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:35.580
Aoi, Aoi!

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:37.350
Which mountain should we do?

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:40.120
I was thinking maybe a nearby 
hill to start with...

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.100
How can you be so half-hearted?

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:43.210
You'll never be popular!

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:45.900
That has nothing to do with it.

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:47.840
How about our local hill?

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:51.910
You'll get us stranded!

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.640
I don't want to die yet!

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:56.050
<i>Though I felt so scared before,</i>

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:57.600
<i>I've come back again.</i>

00:06:58.240 --> 00:07:00.520
<i>Though I felt so out of breath before,</i>

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.850
<i>now I can climb it much more easily.</i>

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:04.600
H-Hello!

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:06.200
Oh, hello!

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.860
<i>This feels kind of like a stroll.</i>

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:12.780
<i>It's fun!</i>

00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:19.860
Last time we went that way,

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:21.780
so maybe I'll try going this way.

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:31.550
<i>Now I see...</i>

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:34.550
<i>It may be a bit steeper,</i>

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:37.060
<i>but...</i>

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:39.350
<i>I'm already at the summit!</i>

00:08:04.800 --> 00:08:05.770
Aoi?

00:08:09.410 --> 00:08:10.440
Hinata!

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.670
Mt. Tenran

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:11.670
Why are you here?!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:19.180
Okumusashi Nature Trails 
Mt. Tenran
195M Saitama Prefecture

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.180
I just got your postcard.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.710
Since you'd written "Mt. Tenran,"

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:23.690
I was feeling a little nostalgic.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:25.320
Oh!

00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:27.080
Why are you here, Hinata?

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:28.100
For a stroll!

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:29.110
What a coincidence!

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:30.340
Yeah.

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:34.360
I was thinking of doing 
Mt. Tonosuyama after this.

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:41.370
Mt. Tenran

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:36.560
Mt. Tonosuyama?

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:38.830
It's another mountain out this way.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.370
Or more like, after this, it's a real mountain.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:42.850
Huh...

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:44.400
Wanna come with me, Aoi?

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:47.190
Huh?

00:08:47.190 --> 00:08:47.790
Let's go!

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:50.170
Hey!

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:51.640
Hinata!

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:52.090
Mt. Tonosuyama                    
Nouninji Temple

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:53.590
Hey, it's all good!

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.590
What's so good about it?!

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:57.700
Sheesh, all right, already!

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:59.580
I can walk on my own!

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:08.420
<i>We walked side by side naturally</i>

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:12.110
<i>As though we shared three legs</i>

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:12.110
Beware of Pit Vipers

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:14.860
Beware of Pit Vipers

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:18.750
<i>Let's get tied together 
with a transparent ribbon</i>

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.660
This spot is called "Looking-Back Slope."

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:23.290
<i>The dreams we each picture on our own</i>

00:09:22.110 --> 00:09:26.620
They say that, long ago, some great person 
looked back from here several times!

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:27.420
<i>Can take shape if we're with each other</i>

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:28.750
That's no explanation at all!

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:30.630
<i>Our hearts skip a beat as we climb!</i>

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:31.380
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:38.300
<i>Our hearts beat with excitement, like a staccato</i>

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:45.060
<i>Because we are here as kindred spirits</i>

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:42.520
Aoi!

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:47.430
<i>Dear My Friend</i>

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:54.150
<i>If we mix a palette of earthen tints, 
what color will tomorrow have?</i>

00:09:54.460 --> 00:10:04.410
<i>Funny how my capacity for 
joy has outgrown my anxiety</i>

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:07.080
<i>See you tomorrow! Yahoo!</i>

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:09.000
Saitama Prefecture, Okumusashi Nature Parks
Mt. Tonosuyama
271m  Hanno City

00:10:17.890 --> 00:10:19.370
It's Skytree!

00:10:19.370 --> 00:10:22.050
We could see it from Mt. Takao, too.

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:30.850
Mt. Fuji...

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:34.060
We really went there, didn't we?

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:34.880
We sure did.

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:38.100
I'm sorry.

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:43.700
Since then, I've felt like I had 
a gaping hole in my heart.

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:47.000
I hated how I'd messed up,

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:49.210
and felt really frustrated too.

00:10:49.930 --> 00:10:51.890
I kept thinking about that.

00:10:52.220 --> 00:10:52.960
But...

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:56.800
I still want to go mountain climbing.

00:10:58.270 --> 00:10:59.380
You do?

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:01.360
Then let's go do it together!

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:05.220
Carefully, bit by bit, until someday, we can 
finally climb the mountain of our memories!

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:06.410
Yeah!

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:07.850
<i>That's right.</i>

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:09.980
<i>If you fall down, then just stand up again.</i>

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:12.400
<i>It could be hard on my own,</i>

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:14.980
<i>but I'll have my friends with me.</i>

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:16.990
Oh, that's right.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.450
Want some sweet bean jelly?

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:24.080
It's the one you gave me earlier.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:25.450
We'll split it.

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:30.460
Why are you laughing?!

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:32.770
Because you've got sweet bean jelly.

00:11:32.770 --> 00:11:34.180
Are you an old man?!

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:37.210
Grr! Now you're getting on my nerves!

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:40.220
You're the one who bought it in the first place!

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:41.960
<i>That's right.</i>

00:11:41.960 --> 00:11:42.970
<i>Step by step.</i>

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:45.350
<i>It's okay to take it slow.</i>

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:49.890
Crown Prince

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:48.530
<i>If you keep walking, even with small steps,</i>

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:50.070
<i>then before you know it,</i>

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:52.550
<i>you'll have reached the summit.</i>

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:55.610
<i>See you tomorrow!</i>

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:56.930
<i>Yahoo!</i>

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:59.980
To Be Continued!
